Description: Markdown editor that keeps the source text as the only truth
 lumos-md edits Markdown files as source text, with syntax colours and
 format commands: lists, bold, italic, links, headings, quotes, code
 blocks and tables. Every edit is a text edit. It follows CommonMark
 0.31.2 and GitHub Flavored Markdown.
